glm_cuda: several waiting prompts fill a chunk each a step (TF_GLM_MULTI_PREFILL, default off; with TF_GLM_FILL=1)

Up to TF_GLM_MULTI_PREFILL_MOST (2) prompts, the oldest always first, then the fewest rows left: a short prompt behind
a long one no longer waits for all of it. Separate forwards, the same chunks as alone, so the same replies.

